{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/thewire.in/posts/amidst-the-din-of-outrage-against-the-comedian-it-is-important-to-remember-one-a/684505460914152/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/thewire.in/posts/amidst-the-din-of-outrage-against-the-comedian-it-is-important-to-remember-one-a/684505460914152/","title":"TheWire.in","description":"Amidst the din of outrage against the comedian, it is important to remember one all-important fact, that not one single thing that Kunal Kamra said in the show can be factually refuted. It’s all...","language":"en","text":"Amidst the din of outrage against the comedian, it is important to remember one all-important fact, that not one single thing that Kunal Kamra said in the show can be factually refuted. It’s all true. And that is the primary reason those in power and their cronies are as upset with him as they are.\n\nIt’s the oldest tactic in the despots’ book. If you can’t refute the truth, attack the truth teller!\n\nAll reactions:\n\n173 comments\n\n223 shares\n\nLike\n\nComment\n\nMost relevant\n\n\n\nGopalakrishna Acharya\n\nWhy he is displaying constitution book. A polticsl leader also displayed it same way. If so at whose behest he is doing this. His true colour will be known if he is handed over to police custody\n\nAbraham Philip\n\nKunal kamra is the best person to understand Indian politics may GOD bless him\n\nSanthosh Kumar\n\nSame pig face'\n\nSuresh Patel\n\nIt is time the citizens become vocal.\n\n1\n\nSandip Dutta\n\nMandir wahi bana liya hai\n\nRachel Thomas\n\nThey arrest every person who dare to expose or question their behaviour\n\nAnna Durai\n\nYes, if you have no answer, then no one will be allowed to open their minds.\n\nBridget Peters\n\nPen is mightier than the .\n\nDiparati Chakrabortty\n\nTruth is anti national in Amritkaal times.\n\n1\n\nView 1 reply","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":3405.9404869985883,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}